# Next options

Whenever a decision is needed, and at the end of every task, give the best next options and mark exactly one as recommended.

- Two to four options, each with a one-line reason or trade-off.
- Put the recommended option first and label it "(Recommended)".
- If the decision blocks progress, ask with the AskQuestion tool instead of listing options in prose.
- Prefer options that move the current milestone forward (`tea milestones ls` shows open and closed counts).

Example ending:

> Next options:
> 1. **(Recommended)** Start epic #89 (multi-tenancy and Super Admin): it unblocks every v0.3.0 SaaS core story.
> 2. Add a staging Cloudron app: safer releases, costs about 1 GB of RAM.
> 3. Automate deploys from GitHub Actions: needs a Cloudron API token as a repository secret.
